{"slug":"drake-disses-kanye-west-on-circo-loco-linking-with-the-opps-b-i-did-that-s-for-j-prince","postId":75326,"title":"Drake Disses Kanye West On Circo Loco, \"Linking With The Opps B*** I Did That S*** For J Prince\"","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":519773,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/https___hypebeast.com_image_2021_07_kanye-west-drake-beef-squashed-000.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-519773\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Hypebeast</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Drake's 7 am On Birdle Path of his Certified Lover Boy album sent a lot direct disses to Kanye West and his camp. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/2g4knnbpA9A\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/2g4knnbpA9A\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the track says \"Told you I'm aimin' straight for the head, not aiming to please<br><a href=\"https://genius.com/23874449/Drake-7am-on-bridle-path/I-could-give-a-fuck-about-who-designing-your-sneakers-and-tees\">I could give a fuck about who designing your sneakers and tees</a>.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In another verse, say, \"Why the f*** we peacemakin', doin' the explanations<br>If we just gon' be right back in that bitch without hesitation?\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well that actually they had to do last year.  Drake and Kanye West ended their beef at the request of  Rap-A-Lot Records CEO J Prince at a  Dave Chappelle comedy show.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1460781901619376143?s=20u0026t=k10jvw32JQCNbgQ7kWhMNA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1460781901619376143?s=20&amp;t=k10jvw32JQCNbgQ7kWhMNA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The two came together to help get to Larry Hoover out of jail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CjNTlEPA7IN/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/CjNTlEPA7IN/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fast forward to the release of  Drake project with 21 Savage and on the single Circo Loco, he disses West again, “linking with the opps bitch i did that shit for j prince, bitch i did it for the mob ties, feel like 17 2 percs frog eyes, i never been the type to apologize i’d rather hit ‘em up 1 more time”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/Yv0QHcalyGU\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/Yv0QHcalyGU\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Hypebeast On Drake's 7 am On Birdle Path of his Certified Lover Boy album sent a lot direct disses to Kanye West and his camp. https://youtu.be/2g4knnbpA9A In the track says \"Told you I'm aimin'…","publishedAt":"2022-11-04T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-11-04T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"uncategorized","name":"Uncategorized"}],"tags":[{"slug":"21-savage","name":"21 Savage"},{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"circo-loco","name":"Circo Loco"},{"slug":"drake","name":"Drake"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"her-loss","name":"Her Loss"},{"slug":"j-prince","name":"J Prince"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/https___hypebeast.com_image_2021_07_kanye-west-drake-beef-squashed-000.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/https___hypebeast.com_image_2021_07_kanye-west-drake-beef-squashed-000.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/drake-disses-kanye-west-on-circo-loco-linking-with-the-opps-b-i-did-that-s-for-j-prince/"}